### Obtain MANAGER JWT
POST http://localhost:8082/realms/car-service/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=car-service-api&username=manager&password=manager123&grant_type=password

> {% client.global.set("manager_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Obtain ADMIN JWT
POST http://localhost:8082/realms/car-service/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=car-service-api&username=admin&password=admin123&grant_type=password

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 401: request without JWT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repair-orders

### List orders as MANAGER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/repair-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### Create order as MANAGER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/repair-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Taras Bondar",
  "phone": "+380931234567",
  "carBrand": "Ford",
  "carModel": "Focus",
  "licensePlate": "KA4455IT",
  "issueDescription": "Air conditioner diagnostics",
  "status": "NEW"
}

### Update order as MANAGER
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/repair-orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Oleksandr Kovalenko",
  "phone": "+380501112233",
  "carBrand": "Toyota",
  "carModel": "Corolla",
  "licensePlate": "AA1234BB",
  "issueDescription": "Engine diagnostics and oil change",
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 403 from SecurityFilterChain for MANAGER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/status
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### 403 from @PreAuthorize for MANAGER
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/repair-orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_token}}

### ADMIN endpoint succeeds
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Delete as ADMIN
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/repair-orders/2
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
